It is Monday morning, and I am sitting on the bus.
I am on my way to work.
I look out of the window.
I am a little nervous today.
But I am also looking forward to it a lot.
A large, new software project starts today.
I have worked as a software engineer at the company since January.
I know my colleague Peter well.
We have worked together since my first day.
But now I must work closely with the whole team.
I will work with our boss, our designer, and our tester.
They have worked at the company for a long time.
The bus stops, and more people get on.
I look at my watch.
It is eight o'clock.
The morning meeting begins in half an hour.
I take a deep breath.
I am ready for the new project.
